#nexus

[Ceratitis capitata sigmavirus (CCapSV): 19 sequences of 1277 sites and the country of each (Morocco, Crete)
 as traits, with coordinates for the map. Longdon et al. 2017, Proc. R. Soc. B 284:20162381; the alignment is the
 authors' Figshare deposit https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.3409420 (CC BY).]

BEGIN TAXA;
DIMENSIONS ntax=19;
TAXLABELS
	[1] 'M_56'
	[2] 'M_54'
	[3] 'M_52'
	[4] 'M_50'
	[5] 'M_37'
